---
permalink: blog.html
title: "J-Keebs | Blog"
description: "Der J-Keebs-Blog: persönliche Geschichten, Projekte, Restaurierungen und technische Experimente rund um mechanische Tastaturen."
og_image: "images/Cherry_J80-3000_I2C.jpg"
twitter_card: "summary_large_image"
active_nav: "blog.html"
---
        <section class="page-hero page-hero--single">
            <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="hero.eyebrow">Blog</p>
            <h1 data-i18n="hero.heading">Gedanken, Projekte und Tastatur-Kaninchenlöcher.</h1>
            <p data-i18n="hero.intro">Hier geht es nicht nur um fertige Tastaturen. Ich erzähle, wie ich überhaupt in dieses Hobby gerutscht bin, was ich aus alten Boards heraushole und welche Ideen mich gerade beschäftigen – inklusive Umwegen, Fehlversuchen und gelegentlichem „Warum habe ich das eigentlich angefangen?“</p>
        </section>

        <section class="section section--muted">
            <div class="section__inner">
                <article class="card blog-featured">
                    <a class="blog-featured__link" href="{{ blogFeatured.url }}">
                        <figure class="blog-featured__media">
                            <img src="{{ blogFeatured.image }}" width="1920" height="1080" loading="eager" decoding="async" alt="{{ blogFeatured.imageAlt }}" title="{{ blogFeatured.imageTitle }}" data-i18n-attr="alt:post{{ blogFeatured.id }}.image.alt,title:post{{ blogFeatured.id }}.image.title">
                        </figure>
                        <div class="blog-featured__body">
                            <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="blog.featuredLabel">Featured</p>
                            <div class="blog-post__header">
                                <p class="blog-post__meta" data-i18n="post{{ blogFeatured.id }}.meta">{{ blogFeatured.meta }}</p>
                                <time class="blog-post__date" datetime="{{ blogFeatured.datetime }}" data-i18n="post{{ blogFeatured.id }}.date">{{ blogFeatured.date }}</time>
                            </div>
                            <h2 data-i18n="post{{ blogFeatured.id }}.title">{{ blogFeatured.title }}</h2>
                            <p class="pullquote" data-i18n="post{{ blogFeatured.id }}.quote">{{ blogFeatured.quote }}</p>
                            <span class="guide-card__cta" data-i18n="cta.readMore">Weiterlesen →</span>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <div class="section__inner blog-teaser-grid">
                {% for article in blogTeasers %}
                <article class="card blog-teaser-card">
                    <a class="guide-card__link" href="{{ article.url }}">
                        <figure class="blog-teaser-card__media">
                            <img src="{{ article.image }}" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="{{ article.imageAlt }}" title="{{ article.imageTitle }}" data-i18n-attr="alt:post{{ article.id }}.image.alt,title:post{{ article.id }}.image.title">
                        </figure>
                        <div class="card__body">
                            <div class="blog-post__header">
                                <p class="blog-post__meta" data-i18n="post{{ article.id }}.meta">{{ article.meta }}</p>
                                <time class="blog-post__date" datetime="{{ article.datetime }}" data-i18n="post{{ article.id }}.date">{{ article.date }}</time>
                            </div>
                            <h3 data-i18n="post{{ article.id }}.title">{{ article.title }}</h3>
                            <p class="blog-teaser-card__excerpt" data-i18n="post{{ article.id }}.excerpt">{{ article.excerpt }}</p>
                            <span class="guide-card__cta" data-i18n="cta.readMore">Weiterlesen →</span>
                        </div>
                    </a>
                </article>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </section>
